      "text": "USBP Special Ops IN ACTION- SEARCH WARRANT EXECUTED- 3 ARRESTED   \n\nUSBP SOD and HSI executed a search and arrest warrant at a home tied to a human smuggling organization in Albuquerque, NM- arresting three illegal aliens. The three Guatemalan nationals climbed onto the neighbor's roof in an attempt to flee but they didn't get far. All are in custody; one faces prosecution for felony illegal re-entry (8USC1326) and the other two will be charged with entry without inspection (8USC1325).   \n\nUSBP remains unwavering in dismantling criminal networks operating in our neighborhoods.",
      "text_resolved": "USBP Special Ops IN ACTION- SEARCH WARRANT EXECUTED- 3 ARRESTED   \n\nUSBP SOD and HSI executed a search and arrest warrant at a home tied to a human smuggling organization in Albuquerque, NM- arresting three illegal aliens. The three Guatemalan nationals climbed onto the neighbor's roof in an attempt to flee but they didn't get far. All are in custody; one faces prosecution for felony illegal re-entry (8USC1326) and the other two will be charged with entry without inspection (8USC1325).   \n\nUSBP remains unwavering in dismantling criminal networks operating in our neighborhoods.",
